# clang-tidy for wasm/shim.c (make lint). make lint defines WUFFS_WASM_LINT, so
# only Wuffs declarations are parsed and the analyzer cannot follow calls into
# the Wuffs release; HeaderFilterRegex also matches no included file.
#
# Disabled checks:
# - bugprone-easily-swappable-parameters: the exports mirror a fixed ABI.
# - bugprone-suspicious-include: shim.c includes the Wuffs .c release by design.
# - clang-analyzer-security.insecureAPI.DeprecatedOrUnsafeBufferHandling: it
#   asks for memset_s/memcpy_s, which wasi-libc does not provide; sizes are
#   checked explicitly at each call.
Checks: >-
  -*,
  bugprone-*,
  clang-analyzer-*,
  -bugprone-easily-swappable-parameters,
  -bugprone-suspicious-include,
  -clang-analyzer-security.insecureAPI.DeprecatedOrUnsafeBufferHandling
WarningsAsErrors: "*"
HeaderFilterRegex: "^$"
